/* Skill icon atlases as sprites, shared by every document that draws a HUD skill icon.
   GENERATED -- one sprite per 20x28 cell of the 256x256 atlases (12 across, 9 down), named
   skill-icon-<atlas>-<lit|grey>-<column>-<row>; UI::Skills::Icon::IconSpriteName() builds the
   names and ResolveSkillIcon() picks the cell. Lit is newui_<atlas>.jpg, grey newui_non_<atlas>.jpg.
   Identical in every theme: the icons are content, not chrome. Master skills use
   master_skill_icons.rcss. */

